flowchart TB
    A[Phase 0: read-only capability discovery] --> B{Route Gate 0:<br/>user selects every track}
    B --> C[Brief, architecture, component selection]
    C --> D[Visual direction] --> E[Appearance and structure freeze]
    C --> F[Electrical architecture] --> G[Schematic] --> H[Schematic freeze]
    C --> I[Shared interfaces] --> J[Interface freeze]
    E --> K[Mechanical: direct MCP, guided, or handoff]
    H --> L[PCB: direct, guided, hybrid, or handoff]
    J --> K
    J --> L
    K --> M[Cross-domain review: board and enclosure match]
    L --> M
    M --> N[EVT validation plan and handoff package]
    B -. lost capability .-> O[waiting_user_decision:<br/>user picks a new route]
